s Al-Salam hospital, two men wearing civilian clothing, their hands tied behind their backs, lay where they had been executed. One, kneeling facedown in the rocky soil, had been shot through the back of the head. The other \endash  a man in his 60s 
\endash  lay prone on his back, a close-range bullet hole gaping open in his face.
